      "writtenOn": "2024-11-06T16:15:24Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "```it-\u003esecond !\u003d connectionPair.second)``` removed intentionally\n\nstreams already have the information about ```{N,O,P}``` in mConnectedDevices. we just connect the {N,P} in the connect step.\n\n\nwhen stream devices updated from ```{N,O,P}``` to ```{N,P}```, it can do the `{O}` disconnection.",
      "parentUuid": "2ea180a0_ad3505d1",
